1
00:00:00,579 --> 00:00:04,239
(Leonard:)Okay. I'll confirm the travel arrangements
in the morning.

2
00:00:04,783 --> 00:00:05,943
(Penny:)Okay, good.

3
00:00:07,052 --> 00:00:09,282
- I do have to ask you one favor.
- Sure.

4
00:00:09,454 --> 00:00:12,754
(Leonard:)Sheldon's nervous about me leaving,
keep an eye on him while I'm gone.

5
00:00:12,924 --> 00:00:17,254
(Penny:)Oh, I don't know. Remember what happened
when I took care of your goldfish?

6
00:00:18,597 --> 00:00:21,537
(Leonard:)Well, flush Sheldon down the toilet
and get me a new one.

7
00:00:24,603 --> 00:00:27,363
(Leonard:)Really, you guys do not need
to throw me a going away party.

8
00:00:27,539 --> 00:00:30,439
(Howard:)Are you kidding me?
How often can you say bon voyage...

9
00:00:30,609 --> 00:00:33,879
(Howard:)...to somebody when they're
actually going on a voyage?

10
00:00:36,047 --> 00:00:37,917
(Amy:)Hello, Rajesh.

11
00:00:40,886 --> 00:00:43,116
(Howard(in Raj accent):)Hello, Amy. Nice to see you.

12
00:00:46,124 --> 00:00:48,824
What can I say, it's funnier with the accent.

13
00:00:49,628 --> 00:00:53,458
(Leonard:)There's beer in the fridge. Anyway, you guys
really don't need to make a big deal.

14
00:00:53,632 --> 00:00:55,062
(Sheldon:)Leonard, you're being selfish.

15
00:00:55,233 --> 00:00:58,293
(Sheldon:)We need to give you a proper send-off
so we'll have closure...

16
00:00:58,470 --> 00:01:02,020
(Sheldon:)...when you die at sea
and crabs eat your face.

